==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|therunder}}, {{m|enm|þer-under}}, {{m|enm|þar under}}, from {{inh|en|ang|þǣrunder}}, equivalent to {{compound|en|there|under}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|daaronder|t=thereunder}}, {{cog|de|darunter|t=thereunder}}, {{cog|sv|därunder|t=thereunder}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|en|ʌndə(ɹ)|s=3}}

===Adverb===
